# Read by `next build` for every production build, wherever it runs — the
# Cloudflare build from git included, which has no `.env.local`. Both values are
# public by design: they are inlined into the static export anyway, and the
# row-level security on `buteyko_log_entries` is what protects the data.
#
# A local `.env.local` still overrides these. A fork that wants to stay
# local-only should delete this file.
